"creates). \n"
"\n"
"I believe, taky there is also mistake/imprecise info - faction selector can "
"also change faction for selected objects. But check that for yourself. \n"
"\n"
"If you want to create your own scenarios, see mission scripting page from "
"there and also mission scripting tutorial on EE's web page. But that is "
"entirely new can of worms."
